id View'=>'网格视图','List View'=>'列表视图','Grid Per Row'=>'每行网格数','Number of listings to show per row for grid view.'=>'网格视图中每行显示的列表数量。','Listings Order by'=>'列表排序依据','Date Posted'=>'发布日期','Views Count'=>'浏览次数','Listings Sort by'=>'列表排序方式','Ascending'=>'升序','Descending'=>'降序','Category / Location Order by'=>'分类/地区排序依据','Id'=>'ID','Count'=>'数量','Slug'=>'别名','Custom Order'=>'自定义排序','None'=>'无','Category / Location Sort by'=>'分类/地区排序方式','Show in Listing'=>'在列表中显示','Use Modern Icon for'=>'使用现代图标于','Draw the listing meta icons (ad type, date, author, category, location, views) in the modern line style used by the Listing Showcase.'=>'以信息展示（Listing Showcase）所用的现代线条风格绘制信息元数据图标（广告类型、日期、作者、分类、位置、浏览量）。','Listing Details Settings'=>'列表详情设置','Listing Details Style'=>'信息详情样式','Design of the listing details page, for both the default and the form builder layout. Classic keeps the previous design.'=>'信息详情页面的设计，适用于默认布局和表单构建器布局。“经典”保留以前的设计。','Enable Report Abuse'=>'启用举报滥用','Enable Print Button'=>'启用打印按钮','Show the Print button on the listing details page.'=>'在信息详情页面显示打印按钮。','Enable Contact Form'=>'启用联系表单','Enable Comment Form'=>'启用评论表单','Disable Gallery Slider'=>'禁用相册轮播','Disable Gallery Video'=>'禁用相册视频','Number of Related Listings'=>'相关列表数量','Number of listings to show as related listing.'=>'作为相关列表显示的列表数量。','Sidebar Position'=>'侧边栏位置','Right'=>'右','Left'=>'左','Bottom'=>'底部','Show in Listing Detail Page'=>'在列表详情页显示','General Settings'=>'常规设置','Enable Payment'=>'启用支付','Enforce SSL on Checkout'=>'在结算时强制使用SSL','Disable Billing Address'=>'禁用账单地址','Email Sender Options'=>'邮件发件人选项','From Name'=>'发件人名称','The name system generated emails are sent from. This should probably be your site or directory name.'=>'系统生成邮件的发件人名称。通常应为您的网站或目录名称。','From Email'=>'发件人邮箱','The sender email address should belong to the site domain.'=>'发件人邮箱地址应属于网站域名。','Admin Notification Emails'=>'管理员通知邮箱','Enter the email address(es) that should receive admin notification emails, one per line.'=>'输入应接收管理员通知邮件的邮箱地址，每行一个。','Others Options'=>'其他选项','You can use the following placeholders'=>'您可以使用以下占位符','Your site name'=>'您的网站名称','Your site name with link'=>'带链接的网站名称','Your site url with link'=>'带链接的网站URL','Administration Email Address'=>'管理员邮箱地址','Link to renewal page'=>'续期页面链接','Current date'=>'当前日期','Current time'=>'当前时间','This section lets you customize the Classified Listing emails. <a href="%s" target="_blank">Click here to preview your email template.</a>'=>'此部分允许您自定义Classified Listing邮件。<a href="%s" target="_blank">点击此处预览您的邮件模板。</a>','Email Content Type'=>'邮件内容类型','Choose which format of email to send.'=>'选择要发送的邮件格式。','Header Image'=>'页眉图片','Upload an image to use as the header for your emails.'=>'上传一张图片作为邮件的页眉。','Footer Text'=>'页脚文本','The text to appear in the footer of emails. Available placeholders: {site_title}'=>'邮件页脚中显示的文本。可用占位符：{site_title}','Base Color'=>'基础颜色','The base color for email templates. Default #0071bd'=>'邮件模板的基础颜色。默认 #0071bd','Background Color'=>'背景颜色','The background color for email templates. Default #f7f7f7'=>'邮件模板的背景颜色。默认 #f7f7f7','Body Background Color'=>'正文背景颜色','The main body background color. Default #ffffff'=>'主体正文背景颜色。默认 #ffffff','Body Text Color'=>'正文文字颜色','The main body text color. Default #3c3c3c'=>'主体正文文字颜色。默认 #3c3c3c','Enable / Disable Notifications'=>'启用/禁用通知','Notify Admin via Email when'=>'在以下情况时通过邮件通知管理员','Notify Users via Email when Their'=>'在以下情况时通过邮件通知用户','Listing Submitted Email ( Confirmation )'=>'列表提交邮件（确认）','To override and edit this email template copy <code>classified-listing/templates/emails/listing-submitted-email-to-owner.php</code> to your theme <code>folder: astra/classified-listing/emails/listing-submitted-email-to-owner.php.</code>'=>'要覆盖和编辑此邮件模板，请将<code>classified-listing/templates/emails/listing-submitted-email-to-owner.php</code>复制到您的主题<code>目录：astra/classified-listing/emails/listing-submitted-email-to-owner.php。</code>','Subject'=>'主题','Heading'=>'标题','Listing Published / Approved Email'=>'列表发布/审核通过邮件','Listing Renewal Email'=>'列表续期邮件','Configure how many days before listing expiration is the renewal email sent.'=>'配置在列表过期前多少天发送续期邮件。','Listing Expired Email'=>'列表过期邮件','Renewal Reminder Email'=>'续期提醒邮件','Configure how many days after the expiration of a listing an email reminder should be sent to the owner.'=>'配置列表过期后多少天应向所有者发送邮件提醒。','New Order'=>'新订单','Order Completed Email'=>'订单完成邮件','Listing Contact Email'=>'列表联系邮件','Account & Policy Settings'=>'账户与政策设置','Account Creation'=>'账户创建','Allow visitor to create an account on the "My account" page'=>'允许访客在"我的账户"页面创建账户','Separate Registration Form'=>'独立注册表单','Separate registration page from login page'=>'将注册页面与登录页面分开','New User Default Role'=>'新用户默认角色','Default Role as WordPress'=>'与WordPress默认角色相同','Editor'=>'编辑者','Contributor'=>'投稿者','Subscriber'=>'订阅者','Listing Manager'=>'列表管理员','Select the role assigned to new users registered through the Classified Listing plugin.'=>'选择通过Classified Listing插件注册的新用户分配的角色。','Social Login Shortcode'=>'社交登录短代码','Add your social login shortcode, which will run at <em style="color:red">rtcl_login_form</em> hook. <strong style="color: green">We will support shortcode from any third party plugin.</strong> Example: [TheChamp-Login], [miniorange_social_login theme="default"]'=>'添加您的社交登录短代码，它将在<em style="color:red">rtcl_login_form</em>钩子上运行。<strong style="color: green">我们支持来自任何第三方插件的短代码。</strong>示例：[TheChamp-Login]、[miniorange_social_login theme="default"]','Registration Fields'=>'注册字段','Hide Name'=>'隐藏姓名','Hide name at registration form'=>'在注册表单中隐藏姓名','Hide Phone Number'=>'隐藏电话号码','Hide phone number at registration form'=>'在注册表单中隐藏电话号码','Required Phone'=>'电话必填','Required phone number at registration form'=>'在注册表单中电话号码为必填','Enable Account Type'=>'启用账户类型','Enable account type at registration form'=>'在注册表单中启用账户类型','Seller Label'=>'卖家标签','Allow users to post listings.'=>'允许用户发布列表。','Buyer Label'=>'买家标签','Disallow users to post listings.'=>'不允许用户发布列表。','Terms and Conditions'=>'条款和条件','Enable Listing Terms and Conditions'=>'启用列表条款和条件','Display and require user agreement to Terms and Conditions for Listing form.'=>'在列表表单中显示并要求用户同意条款和条件。','Enable Terms and Conditions at Checkout Page'=>'在结算页面启用条款和条件','Display and require user agreement to Terms and Conditions at checkout page.'=>'在结算页面显示并要求用户同意条款和条件。','Enable Terms and Conditions at Registration'=>'在注册时启用条款和条件','Display and require user agreement to Terms and Conditions at registration page.'=>'在注册页面显示并要求用户同意条款和条件。','Terms and Conditions Page'=>'条款和条件页面','Choose a page to act as your Terms and Conditions.'=>'选择一个页面作为您的条款和条件。','I have read and agree to the website [terms].'=>'我已阅读并同意网站[terms]。','Optionally add some text for the terms checkbox that customers must accept.'=>'可选为客户必须接受的条款复选框添加一些文本。','Privacy Policy'=>'隐私政策','This section controls the display of your website privacy policy. The privacy notices below will not show up unless a privacy page is first set.'=>'此部分控制您网站隐私政策的显示。除非先设置隐私页面，否则以下隐私通知不会显示。','Privacy Page'=>'隐私页面','Choose a page to act as your privacy policy.'=>'选择一个页面作为您的隐私政策。','Registration Privacy Policy'=>'注册隐私政策','Your personal data will be used to support your experience throughout this website, to manage access to your account, and for other purposes described in our [privacy_policy].'=>'您的个人数据将用于支持您在本网站的使用体验、管理您的账户访问权限，以及我们[privacy_policy]中描述的其他用途。','Optionally add some text about your store privacy policy to show on account registration forms.'=>'可选添加一些关于您商店隐私政策的文本，以在账户注册表单上显示。','Checkout Privacy Policy'=>'结算隐私政策','Your personal data will be used to process your order, support your experience throughout this website, and for other purposes described in our [privacy_policy].'=>'您的个人数据将用于处理您的订单、支持您在本网站的使用体验，以及我们[privacy_policy]中描述的其他用途。','Optionally add some text about your store privacy policy to show during checkout.'=>'可选添加一些关于您商店隐私政策的文本，以在结算时显示。','Global Style'=>'全局样式','Primary'=>'主色','Link Color'=>'链接颜色','Link Color on Hover'=>'链接悬停颜色','Button Background'=>'按钮背景','Button Hover Background'=>'按钮悬停背景','Button Text Color'=>'按钮文字颜色','Button Text Color on Hover'=>'按钮悬停文字颜色','Label Style'=>'标签样式','New Label Background Color'=>'新标签背景颜色','New Label Text Color'=>'新标签文字颜色','Feature Label Background Color'=>'推荐标签背景颜色','Feature Label Text Color'=>'推荐标签文字颜色','Card Style'=>'卡片样式','Featured Card Background Color'=>'精选卡片背景色','Featured Card Border Color'=>'精选卡片边框色','Top Card Background Color'=>'置顶卡片背景色','Top Card Border Color'=>'置顶卡片边框色','New Card Background Color'=>'新发布卡片背景色','New Card Border Color'=>'新发布卡片边框色','Popular Card Background Color'=>'热门卡片背景色','Popular Card Border Color'=>'热门卡片边框色','BumpUp Card Background Color'=>'BumpUp 卡片背景色','BumpUp Card Border Color'=>'BumpUp 卡片边框色','Others Style'=>'其他样式','Container Class'=>'容器类','Add theme container class here to adjust width'=>'在此处添加主题容器类以调整宽度','Sidebar Width'=>'侧边栏宽度','Phone Number Field'=>'电话号码字段','Controls the country-code dropdown used on phone/WhatsApp fields (e.g. the Account Details form).'=>'Controla el menú desplegable de código de país usado en campos de teléfono/WhatsApp (ej. el formulario de Detalles de cuenta).','Default Country'=>'默认国家','Pre-selected country code when a phone field is empty.'=>'Código de país preseleccionado cuando un campo de teléfono está vacío.','Allowed Countries'=>'允许的国家','Restrict the country-code dropdown to these countries. Leave empty to allow all.'=>'Restringir el menú desplegable de código de país a estos países. Dejar vacío para permitir todos.','Custom Country Codes'=>'自定义国家代码','Correct a built-in country calling code, or add a country that is not in the list. Type any country name — the suggestions are only a shortcut, and you are not limited to them.'=>'更正内置的国家电话区号，或添加列表中没有的国家。可输入任意国家名称 — 建议项仅为快捷方式，不限于这些选项。','Country Calling Codes'=>'国家电话区号','Enter the country calling code only — never the area code. The Dominican Republic is "+1", not "+1809"; the 809/829/849 area code is part of the number the caller dials. Adding an area code here would stop every other number in that country from being entered. The Code column is the 2-letter country code (DO, US, GB); it fills in automatically when a country is recognised.'=>'仅输入国家电话区号 — 切勿输入地区号。多米尼加共和国是 "+1"，而不是 "+1809"；809/829/849 地区号是拨号号码的一部分。在此添加地区号会导致该国家的其他号码都无法输入。“代码”列为两位字母国家代码（DO、US、GB），识别出国家后会自动填写。','Google reCAPTCHA'=>'Google reCAPTCHA','Enable reCAPTCHA in'=>'在以下位置启用reCAPTCHA','reCAPTCHA Version'=>'reCAPTCHA版本','reCAPTCHA v3'=>'reCAPTCHA v3','reCAPTCHA v2'=>'reCAPTCHA v2','Google reCAPTCHA v2 will show in the form and reCAPTCHA v3 will show in the browser corner.'=>'Google reCAPTCHA v2将显示在表单中，reCAPTCHA v3将显示在浏览器角落。','Site Key'=>'站点密钥','<span style="color: red">Google reCAPTCHA v2 and v3, site key and secrect key will be different.</span> How to generate reCAPTCHA <a target="_blank" href="https://www.radiustheme.com/docs/faqs/add-re-captcha/">Click here</a>'=>'<span style="color: red">Google reCAPTCHA v2和v3的站点密钥和私密密钥是不同的。</span>如何生成reCAPTCHA <a target="_blank" href="https://www.radiustheme.com/docs/faqs/add-re-captcha/">点击此处</a>','Secret Key'=>'私密密钥','Image Sizes'=>'图片尺寸','Gallery Slider'=>'相册轮播','This image size is being used in the image slider on Listing details pages.'=>'此图片尺寸用于列表详情页的图片轮播。','Gallery thumbnail image size'=>'相册缩略图尺寸','Thumbnail'=>'缩略图','Listing thumbnail size will use all listing page'=>'列表缩略图尺寸将应用于所有列表页面','Allowed Image Type'=>'允许的图片类型','PNG'=>'PNG','JPG'=>'JPG','JPEG'=>'JPEG','WebP'=>'WebP','Allowed Image Memory Size'=>'允许的图片内存大小','Enter the image memory size, like 2 for 2 MB (only number without MB) <span style="color: red">Your hosting allowed maximum 300 MB</span>'=>'输入图片内存大小，如2代表2 MB（仅输入数字，不含MB）<span style="color: red">您的主机允许的最大值为300 MB</span>','Placeholder Image'=>'占位图片','Select an Image to display as placeholder if have no image.'=>'选择一张图片作为无图片时的占位图。','Enable Map'=>'启用地图','Map Type'=>'地图类型','OpenStreetMap'=>'OpenStreetMap','Google Map'=>'Google地图','Google Map API Key'=>'Google地图API密钥','How to generate Google Map API key <a target="_blank" href="https://www.radiustheme.com/docs/classified-listing/docs/main-settings/misc-settings/">Click here</a>'=>'如何生成Google地图API密钥 <a target="_blank" href="https://www.radiustheme.com/docs/classified-listing/docs/main-settings/misc-settings/">点击此处</a>','Map View Center Position'=>'地图视图中心位置','How the archive map frames itself: <strong>Show all pins together</strong> fits every visible listing, and falls back to the crowded/central area when they cannot all fit without blank space; <strong>Densest area</strong> zooms into the region that holds the most listings.'=>'Cómo se enmarca el mapa del archivo: <strong>Mostrar todos los marcadores juntos</strong> ajusta todos los anuncios visibles, y recurre al área más concurrida/central cuando no pueden caber todos sin espacio en blanco; <strong>Área más densa</strong> hace zoom en la región con más anuncios.','Show all pins together'=>'一起显示所有标记','Densest area (zoom to busiest region)'=>'最密集区域（缩放到最繁忙的地区）','Map Zoom Level'=>'地图缩放级别','Select the default zoom level for the map.'=>'选择地图的默认缩放级别。','Map Default Location'=>'地图默认位置','Location Detection'=>'位置检测','Configure how user location is detected for auto-filling location fields in forms.'=>'配置如何检测用户位置，以自动填写表单中的位置字段。','Detection Mode'=>'检测模式','Disabled - Do not detect location'=>'禁用 - 不检测位置','Manual - Show "Detect Location" button'=>'手动 - 显示“检测位置”按钮','Auto - Detect automatically on page load'=>'自动 - 页面加载时自动检测','Manual mode shows a button next to location fields. Auto mode attempts detection when the page loads (may prompt for permission).'=>'手动模式会在位置字段旁显示一个按钮。自动模式会在页面加载时尝试检测（可能会请求权限）。','Detection Method'=>'检测方式','IP Address Only'=>'仅 IP 地址','Browser GPS with IP Fallback'=>'浏览器 GPS（失败时使用 IP）','IP Address uses MaxMind database or ip-api.com (no permission required). Browser GPS is more accurate but requires HTTPS and user permission.'=>'IP 地址方式使用 MaxMind 数据库或 ip-api.com（无需权限）。浏览器 GPS 更准确，但需要 HTTPS 和用户授权。','MaxMind Geolocation'=>'MaxMind地理定位','An integration for utilizing MaxMind to do Geolocation lookups. Please note that this integration will only do country lookups.'=>'使用MaxMind进行地理定位查询的集成。请注意，此集成仅进行国家级别的查询。','MaxMind License Key'=>'MaxMind许可证密钥','Enter license key'=>'输入许可证密钥','The key that will be used when dealing with MaxMind Geolocation services. You can read how to generate one in <a target="_blank" href="https://docs.woocommerce.com/document/maxmind-geolocation-integration/">MaxMind Geolocation Integration documentation.</a>'=>'与MaxMind地理定位服务交互时使用的密钥。您可以在<a target="_blank" href="https://docs.woocommerce.com/document/maxmind-geolocation-integration/">MaxMind地理定位集成文档</a>中了解如何生成。','Database File Path'=>'数据库文件路径','Permalink Slugs'=>'固定链接别名','NOTE: Just make sure that, after updating the fields in this section, you flush the rewrite rules by visiting Settings > Permalinks. Otherwise you\'ll still see the old links.'=>'注意：确保在更新此部分的字段后，通过访问设置 > 固定链接来刷新重写规则。否则您仍然会看到旧链接。','Listing Base'=>'列表基础路径','Listing base permalink. Default rtcl_listing'=>'列表基础固定链接。默认 rtcl_listing','Listing Category Base'=>'列表分类基础路径','Listing category base permalink.'=>'列表分类基础固定链接。','Listing Location Base'=>'列表地区基础路径','Listing location base permalink.'=>'列表地区基础固定链接。','Page Setup'=>'页面设置','These pages need to be set so that listing endpoint.'=>'需要设置这些页面以用于列表端点。','Base Template'=>'基础模板','Select base template'=>'选择基础模板','Theme Template'=>'主题模板','Classified Listing Template'=>'Classified Listing模板','Listings Page'=>'列表页面','This is the page where all the active listings are displayed.'=>'此页面显示所有活跃列表。','Listing Form Page'=>'列表表单页面','This is the listing form page used to add or edit listing details. The [rtcl_listing_form] short code must be on this page.'=>'此页面用于添加或编辑列表详情。[rtcl_listing_form]短代码必须在此页面上。','This is the page where the users can view/edit their account info. The [rtcl_my_account] short code must be on this page.'=>'此页面供用户查看/编辑其账户信息。[rtcl_my_account]短代码必须在此页面上。','Checkout Page'=>'结算页面','This is the checkout page where users will complete their purchases. The [rtcl_checkout] short code must be on this page.'=>'此结算页面供用户完成购买。[rtcl_checkout]短代码必须在此页面上。','Account Endpoints'=>'账户端点','Endpoints are appended to your page URLs to handle specific actions on the accounts pages. They should be unique and can be left blank to disable the endpoint.'=>'端点会附加到您的页面URL以处理账户页面上的特定操作。它们应该是唯一的，可以留空以禁用端点。','Edit Account'=>'编辑账户','Lost Password'=>'找回密码','Checkout Endpoints'=>'结算端点','Endpoints are appended to your page URLs to handle specific actions during the checkout process. They should be unique.'=>'端点会附加到您的页面URL以处理结算过程中的特定操作。它们应该是唯一的。','Submission'=>'提交','Payment Receipt'=>'付款收据','Payment Failure'=>'付款失败','Visit the Page'=>'访问页面','Data Management'=>'数据管理','You can remove all classified listing cache from here. <a href="%s">Clear all cache</a>'=>'您可以从此处清除所有分类列表缓存。<a href="%s">清除所有缓存</a>','Delete All Data'=>'删除所有数据','Allow to delete all listing data during delete this plugin'=>'删除此插件时允许删除所有列表数据','AI Integration Settings'=>'AI集成设置','To integrate with Write with AI services, you need to obtain an API key from your chosen provider. Visit the respective service provider’s website to generate an API key.'=>'要与AI写作服务集成，您需要从所选提供商获取API密钥。请访问相应服务提供商的网站生成API密钥。','AI Tools'=>'AI工具','-- Select AI Tools --'=>'-- 选择 AI 工具 --','ChatGPT'=>'ChatGPT','Google Gemini'=>'Google Gemini','DeepSeek'=>'DeepSeek','Anthropic Claude'=>'Anthropic Claude','GPT Model'=>'GPT模型','GPT-4o (Full Version)'=>'GPT-4o（完整版）','GPT-4o Mini (Light Version)'=>'GPT-4o Mini（精简版）','ChatGPT API Key'=>'ChatGPT API密钥','To integrate with ChatGPT, you need to obtain an API key from OpenAI. Visit <a href="https://platform.openai.com/account/api-keys" target="_blank">OpenAI API Keys</a> to generate one.'=>'要与ChatGPT集成，您需要从OpenAI获取API密钥。访问<a href="https://platform.openai.com/account/api-keys" target="_blank">OpenAI API密钥</a>以生成一个。','Gemini Model'=>'Gemini模型','Gemini 3.5 Flash'=>'Gemini 3.5 Flash','Gemini 3.1 Pro (Preview)'=>'Gemini 3.1 Pro（预览）','Gemini API Key'=>'Gemini API密钥','To integrate with Google Gemini, you need to obtain an API key from Google Cloud. Visit <a target="_blank" href="https://makersuite.google.com/app/apikey">Google AI Studio API Keys</a> to generate one.'=>'要与Google Gemini集成，您需要从Google Cloud获取API密钥。访问<a target="_blank" href="https://makersuite.google.com/app/apikey">Google AI Studio API密钥</a>以生成一个。','DeepSeek Model'=>'DeepSeek模型','DeepSeek Chat (Full Version)'=>'DeepSeek Chat（完整版）','DeepSeek Reasoner Mini (Light Version)'=>'DeepSeek Reasoner Mini（精简版）','DeepSeek API Key'=>'DeepSeek API密钥','To integrate with DeepSeek, you need to obtain an API key from DeepSeek. Visit <a target="_blank" href="https://www.deepseek.com/api-keys">DeepSeek API Keys</a> to generate one.'=>'要与DeepSeek集成，您需要从DeepSeek获取API密钥。访问<a target="_blank" href="https://www.deepseek.com/api-keys">DeepSeek API密钥</a>以生成一个。','Claude Model'=>'Claude模型','Claude Opus 4.7 (Full Version)'=>'Claude Opus 4.7（完整版）','Claude Sonnet 4.6 (Balanced)'=>'Claude Sonnet 4.6（均衡版）','Claude Haiku 4.5 (Light Version)'=>'Claude Haiku 4.5（精简版）','Claude API Key'=>'Claude API密钥','To integrate with Anthropic Claude, you need to obtain an API key from Anthropic. Visit <a target="_blank" href="https://console.anthropic.com/settings/keys">Anthropic API Keys</a> to generate one.'=>'要与Anthropic Claude集成，您需要从Anthropic获取API密钥。访问<a target="_blank" href="https://console.anthropic.com/settings/keys">Anthropic API密钥</a>以生成一个。','Maximum Characters in Prompt Input'=>'提示输入最大字符数','Set the maximum character limit for the prompt input. This controls how many characters users can enter, ensuring input stays concise and manageable. Higher limits may affect performance and response quality.'=>'设置提示输入的最大字符限制。此项控制用户可以输入的字符数，确保输入保持简洁和可管理。较高的限制可能会影响性能和响应质量。','Search & Media'=>'搜索与媒体','Manage Semantic Search and Media Enhancement.'=>'管理语义搜索和媒体增强。','Semantic Search'=>'语义搜索','Enable AI search instead of keyword matching to get listings'=>'启用AI搜索代替关键词匹配来获取列表','Minimum Accuracy (in percentage)'=>'最低准确度（百分比）','Number of accuracy percentage to match the keywords. The higher the value, the more accurate the search results.'=>'匹配关键词的准确度百分比。值越高，搜索结果越准确。','Enable Best Matching Search'=>'启用最佳匹配搜索','Enable AI quick search with keyword field on ajax filter'=>'在Ajax筛选的关键词字段上启用AI快速搜索','Best Matching (in percentage)'=>'最佳匹配（百分比）','Image Enhancement'=>'图片增强','Enable image modification feature using AI to enhance listing images.'=>'启用使用AI增强列表图片的图片修改功能。','External Importers'=>'外部导入器','Configure pulling listings from external sources (RSS feeds, Google Places). CSV import is available under Tools › Export / Import.'=>'配置从外部来源（RSS订阅、Google Places）拉取列表。CSV导入可在工具 › 导出/导入中使用。','Google Places API Key'=>'Google Places API密钥','Required to import listings from Google Maps. The key must have the new <strong>Places API</strong> enabled in your Google Cloud project. Visit <a href="https://console.cloud.google.com/apis/credentials" target="_blank">Google Cloud Credentials</a> to create one.'=>'从Google Maps导入列表时必需。密钥必须在您的Google Cloud项目中启用新的<strong>Places API</strong>。访问<a href="https://console.cloud.google.com/apis/credentials" target="_blank">Google Cloud凭证</a>以创建一个。','Default Listing Status'=>'默认列表状态','Pending Review'=>'待审核','Status assigned to listings created by an importer when the source does not specify one.'=>'当来源未指定状态时，分配给导入器创建的列表的状态。','Update Existing Listings'=>'更新现有列表','When a record from the source matches a previously-imported listing, refresh it instead of skipping. Match is by source + source id.'=>'当来源中的记录与之前导入的列表匹配时，刷新它而不是跳过。匹配方式为来源+来源ID。','Max Listings per Run'=>'每次运行最大列表数','Hard cap on the number of listings any single import run will create. Google Places enforces an upper bound of 60.'=>'任何单次导入运行创建的列表数量硬上限。Google Places强制上限为60。','Default Fallback Image URL'=>'默认备用图片URL','Image used when an importer is configured to use a fallback instead of (or in addition to) source photos. Paste any publicly-reachable image URL. Leave empty to disable the fallback option.'=>'当导入器配置为使用备用图片（替代或补充来源照片）时使用的图片。粘贴任何可公开访问的图片URL。留空以禁用备用选项。','Item title'=>'项目标题','Pl