d themes.'=>'使用高级扩展和主题，扩展并美化您的分类信息网站。','All'=>'全部','Add-ons'=>'扩展','Themes'=>'主题','All tags'=>'所有标签','items'=>'项','See all'=>'查看全部','No add-ons match your filters.'=>'没有符合筛选条件的扩展。','See all add-ons'=>'查看所有扩展','No themes match your filters.'=>'没有符合筛选条件的主题。','See all themes'=>'查看所有主题','Child categories'=>'子分类','Child locations'=>'子地区','Check this to enable Favourite'=>'勾选此项以启用收藏','Enable renew listing'=>'启用续期列表','Allow pending listing to publish after payment success (Pay per ad & promotions)'=>'允许待审核列表在付款成功后发布（按广告付费和推广）','Export'=>'导出','RSS Feeds'=>'RSS订阅','Google Places'=>'Google Places','History'=>'历史记录','Export Import Settings'=>'导出导入设置','Import listings from external sources and map them to your forms'=>'从外部来源导入列表并映射到您的表单','Google Places API key missing'=>'缺少Google Places API密钥','Add the key in <a href="%s">Settings → Import</a> before searching.'=>'搜索前请在<a href="%s">设置 → 导入</a>中添加密钥。','Search Google Places'=>'搜索Google Places','Find businesses on Google, then choose which ones to import as listings.'=>'在Google上查找商家，然后选择要导入为列表的商家。','e.g. pizza in Manhattan, plumber Austin TX'=>'例如：北京火锅、上海装修','ISO-3166-1 α-2'=>'ISO-3166-1 α-2','us, gb, bd…'=>'cn, us, gb…','Bias by location'=>'按位置偏好','The map could not be loaded. Your Google API key needs the “Maps JavaScript API” (and “Places API”) enabled in Google Cloud. You can still set the location bias by typing the latitude, longitude and radius below.'=>'无法加载地图。您的 Google API 密钥需要在 Google Cloud 中启用“Maps JavaScript API”（以及“Places API”）。您仍可在下方输入纬度、经度和半径来设置位置偏好。','Search a place or address (e.g. Dhaka) and press Enter…'=>'搜索地点或地址（例如：北京）并按回车…','Locate'=>'定位','Type a place name and press Enter (or click Locate), or click / drag the pin to set the center. Drag the circle edge or change the radius to set how far around it to search. Leave the fields empty for no location bias.'=>'输入地点名称并按回车（或点击定位），或点击/拖动标记设置中心。拖动圆圈边缘或更改半径以设置搜索范围。留空表示不设位置偏好。','Lat'=>'纬度','Lng'=>'经度','Radius (m)'=>'半径（米）','Max results'=>'最大结果数','Google caps Text Search at 60 results per query (3 pages × 20). Higher values make multiple billed calls.'=>'Google将文本搜索限制为每次查询60个结果（3页 × 20）。更高的值将产生多次计费调用。','Select places to import'=>'选择要导入的地点','Select / deselect all'=>'全选/取消全选','Target Form & Field Mapping'=>'目标表单与字段映射','Choose the form that receives imported data and match each Google field to it.'=>'选择接收导入数据的表单并将每个Google字段映射到它。','Target Form'=>'目标表单','Pick the form whose fields should receive the imported data'=>'选择应接收导入数据的表单','— Use default form —'=>'— 使用默认表单 —','default'=>'默认','Configure an AI provider under Settings → AI Integration to enable.'=>'在设置 → AI集成中配置AI提供商以启用。','Auto-suggest with AI'=>'使用AI自动建议','Save mapping'=>'保存映射','Reset mapping'=>'重置映射','Google Places field'=>'Google Places字段','Form field'=>'表单字段','Listing defaults'=>'列表默认值','Applied to every imported listing.'=>'应用到每个导入的列表。','Listing Status'=>'列表状态','Use global default'=>'使用全局默认','Default Category'=>'默认分类','— None —'=>'— 无 —','Default Location'=>'默认地区','Import options'=>'导入选项','Control quota usage, images, and AI enrichment.'=>'控制配额使用、图片和AI增强。','Light import (skip Place Details — save quota)'=>'轻量导入（跳过地点详情 — 节省配额）','Uses only the data already loaded by Search — no GetPlaceRequest calls. Imports title, address, location, categories, and the 400px preview thumbnail. Phone, website, business hours, rating, and editorial description will NOT be imported (those require Place Details).'=>'仅使用搜索已加载的数据 — 无GetPlaceRequest调用。导入标题、地址、位置、分类和400px预览缩略图。电话、网站、营业时间、评分和编辑描述将不会被导入（这些需要地点详情）。','Featured image source'=>'推荐图片来源','Choose how listings get a featured image. "No image" is useful when Place Photos quota is exhausted or when you just want the textual data.'=>'选择列表如何获取推荐图片。当地点照片配额用尽或只需要文本数据时，"无图片"很有用。','Use Google place photos (billed)'=>'使用Google地点照片（计费）','Use default fallback image'=>'使用默认备用图片','configure URL in Settings → Import'=>'在设置 → 导入中配置URL','No image (skip photo downloads)'=>'无图片（跳过照片下载）','Refresh existing listings (dedupe by Google place_id)'=>'刷新现有列表（按Google place_id去重）','Import Google reviews as listing reviews'=>'将Google评价导入为列表评价','Fetch each place\'s reviews and store them as native (approved) listing reviews with their star rating. Google returns at most 5 reviews per place, and this uses a higher-cost API tier — leave off if you don\'t need reviews.'=>'获取每个地点的评价并将其存储为带有星级评分的原生（已批准）列表评价。Google每个地点最多返回5条评价，这使用更高成本的API层级 — 如果不需要评价请关闭。','Max reviews per place'=>'每个地点最大评价数','How many reviews to import per place (1-5). Google never returns more than 5.'=>'每个地点导入多少评价（1-5）。Google最多返回5条。','Auto-generate description with AI when source has none'=>'当来源无描述时使用AI自动生成描述','Google only provides a description for a small subset of businesses. With this on, the AI writes a short 2-3 sentence description from name / address / categories when the source is empty. One AI call per record.'=>'Google仅为少数商家提供描述。开启此选项后，当来源为空时，AI将根据名称/地址/分类编写2-3句简短描述。每条记录一次AI调用。','Use AI to fill all empty form fields per record'=>'使用AI填充每条记录的所有空表单字段','Broader fill (every empty target field). Capped at 10 records per run. Each enriched record is one extra AI call.'=>'更广泛的填充（每个空目标字段）。每次运行上限10条记录。每条增强记录额外一次AI调用。','Import selected'=>'导入选中项','Each selected place is one Place Details + photo download. Costs apply on your Google Cloud project.'=>'每个选中的地点需要一次地点详情 + 照片下载。费用将计入您的Google Cloud项目。','History tab'=>'历史记录选项卡','You don\'t need to stay on this page — you can check the progress anytime from the'=>'您不需要留在此页面 — 您可以随时从以下位置查看进度','RSS'=>'RSS','Running'=>'运行中','Partial'=>'部分完成','Failed'=>'失败','Import History'=>'导入历史','Every import run, with counts and per-run actions.'=>'每次导入运行，包含计数和每次运行的操作。','Source'=>'来源','All sources'=>'所有来源','All statuses'=>'所有状态','%d run␀%d runs'=>'%d 次运行','Delete selected'=>'删除选中项','Select all on this page'=>'选择此页全部','Started'=>'已开始','Key'=>'密钥','In'=>'导入','Upd'=>'更新','Skip'=>'跳过','Errs'=>'错误','No import runs recorded yet.'=>'尚无导入运行记录。','Run again'=>'再次运行','%d error␀%d errors'=>'%d 个错误','Page %1$d of %2$d'=>'第%1$d页，共%2$d页','Off (manual only)'=>'关闭（仅手动）','Hourly'=>'每小时','Twice daily'=>'每天两次','Daily'=>'每天','Weekly'=>'每周','Add an RSS / Atom Feed'=>'添加RSS/Atom订阅','Pull listings automatically from any RSS or Atom source.'=>'自动从任何RSS或Atom来源拉取列表。','Feed URL'=>'订阅源URL','Friendly name'=>'友好名称','Schedule'=>'定时计划','Re-import behavior'=>'重新导入行为','Update existing listings on re-import'=>'重新导入时更新现有列表','Dedupe by source + GUID so re-runs refresh existing listings instead of creating duplicates.'=>'按来源+GUID去重，使重新运行时刷新现有列表而不是创建重复项。','Test feed'=>'测试订阅','Save feed'=>'保存订阅','Saved Feeds'=>'已保存的订阅','Feeds you\'ve added — run them on demand or remove them.'=>'您已添加的订阅 — 按需运行或删除。','Last Run'=>'上次运行','No saved feeds yet.'=>'尚无已保存的订阅。','Run now'=>'立即运行','Import Location, Categories & Settings'=>'导入地区、分类和设置','Restore taxonomies and settings from a previously exported JSON file.'=>'从之前导出的JSON文件恢复分类法和设置。','Select JSON file'=>'选择JSON文件','Choose JSON file…'=>'选择JSON文件…','Browse'=>'浏览','Need a starting point?'=>'需要一个起点？','Download sample data'=>'下载示例数据','Import settings'=>'导入设置','Import Listings'=>'导入列表','Upload a CSV file, then map its columns to listing fields below.'=>'上传CSV文件，然后将其列映射到下方的列表字段。','Select CSV file'=>'选择CSV文件','Choose CSV file…'=>'选择CSV文件…','Import listings'=>'导入列表','Recommended server limits'=>'建议的服务器限制','PHP memory limit: 512M · PHP max input variables: 3000. Raise these before large imports.'=>'PHP内存限制：512M · PHP最大输入变量：3000。大量导入前请提高这些限制。','Please don\'t refresh the page or click the back button.'=>'请勿刷新页面或点击返回按钮。','The import process is still in progress. Refreshing or navigating away may cause errors or data loss. Kindly wait until the process is complete.'=>'导入过程仍在进行中。刷新或离开页面可能导致错误或数据丢失。请等待过程完成。','Manage the ad types (e.g. Sell, Buy, Exchange) users can choose when posting a listing. Drag to reorder.'=>'管理用户发布信息时可选择的广告类型（例如出售、求购、交换）。拖动以排序。','Add new type'=>'添加新类型','The ID is generated from the name and can be edited later.'=>'ID 根据名称自动生成，之后可以编辑。','Type name'=>'类型名称','e.g. Rent'=>'例如：出租','Add Type'=>'添加类型','All types'=>'所有类型','Job Manager needs this type, so its ID can\'t be changed and it can\'t be deleted.'=>'Job Manager 需要此类型，因此无法更改其 ID，也无法删除。','Required by Job Manager'=>'Job Manager 必需','Required by Job Manager, can\'t be deleted'=>'Job Manager 必需，无法删除','Locked: Job Manager uses this ID.'=>'已锁定：Job Manager 正在使用此 ID。','No listing type found'=>'未找到列表类型','Allow users to add map for their listings'=>'允许用户为其列表添加地图','GoogleMap'=>'Google地图','How to generate Google Map API key'=>'如何生成Google地图API密钥','<span style="color: red">Map Api key is required.</span>'=>'<span style="color: red">需要地图API密钥。</span>','The key that will be used when dealing with MaxMind Geolocation services. You can read how to generate one in <a href="%1$s">MaxMind Geolocation Integration documentation</a>.'=>'与MaxMind地理定位服务交互时使用的密钥。您可以在<a href="%1$s">MaxMind地理定位集成文档</a>中了解如何生成。','The location that the MaxMind database should be stored. By default, the integration will automatically save the database here.'=>'MaxMind数据库应存储的位置。默认情况下，集成将自动在此处保存数据库。','Galley Slider'=>'相册轮播','Width'=>'宽度','Height'=>'高度','Hard Crop'=>'硬裁剪','Enter the image memory size, like 2 for 2 MB (only number without MB) <br><span style="color: red">Your hosting allowed maximum %s</span>'=>'输入图片内存大小，如2代表2 MB（仅输入数字，不含MB）<br><span style="color: red">您的主机允许的最大值为%s</span>','Google reCAPTCHA v2 and v3, site key and secrect key will be different.'=>'Google reCAPTCHA v2和v3的站点密钥和私密密钥是不同的。','How to generate reCAPTCHA'=>'如何生成reCAPTCHA','Enable business hours'=>'启用营业时间','Enable social profiles'=>'启用社交资料','User can edit image size , can crop , can make feature'=>'用户可以编辑图片尺寸、裁剪和设为推荐','Charge users for posting classified ads on your site.'=>'向用户收取在您网站上发布分类广告的费用。','Check this to force users to be redirected to the secure checkout page. You must have an SSL certificate installed to use this option.'=>'勾选此项以强制用户重定向到安全结算页面。您必须安装SSL证书才能使用此选项。','Disable billing address'=>'禁用账单地址','Total Users'=>'用户总数','Revenue'=>'收入','Select date range'=>'选择日期范围','Monthly'=>'按月','Yearly'=>'按年','Listings Distribution'=>'信息分布','Listing Views'=>'信息浏览量','Top Listings by Views'=>'浏览量最高的信息','Show 5'=>'显示 5 条','Show 10'=>'显示 10 条','Show 15'=>'显示 15 条','Check this to enable Report abuse'=>'勾选此项以启用举报滥用','Allows visitors to contact listing authors privately. Authors will receive the messages via email.'=>'允许访客私下联系列表作者。作者将通过邮件收到消息。','Enable Review Form'=>'启用评价表单','Allow visitors to review your listing.'=>'允许访客对您的列表发表评价。','Disable'=>'禁用','Number of listings to show as related listing'=>'作为相关列表显示的列表数量','px'=>'px','%'=>'%','Country code'=>'国家代码','State code'=>'省/州代码','Rate&nbsp;%'=>'税率&nbsp;%','Tax name'=>'税费名称','Priority'=>'优先级','Insert row'=>'插入行','Remove selected row(s)'=>'移除选中的行','Enable tax.'=>'启用税费。','Select Parent'=>'选择上级','Show only the immediate children of the selected category. Displays all the top level categories if no parent is selected.'=>'仅显示所选分类的直接子分类。如果未选择上级，则显示所有顶级分类。','Show image of the Categories'=>'显示分类图片','Show icon of the Categories'=>'显示分类图标','Hide Empty Categories'=>'隐藏空分类','Show Listing Counts'=>'显示列表数量','All Location'=>'所有地区','Selected Location'=>'已选地区','Inline'=>'行内','New Line'=>'新行','6 Col'=>'6列','4 Col'=>'4列','3 Col'=>'3列','2 Col'=>'2列','1 Col'=>'1列','No posts found.'=>'未找到文章。','Card Border Radius'=>'卡片圆角','Enable translate card on hover'=>'启用悬停时卡片上移','Lift the card slightly when the visitor hovers over it. Turning this off keeps the border and shadow hover effect.'=>'访客悬停时将卡片轻微上移。关闭后仍保留边框和阴影的悬停效果。','Content'=>'内容','Location Display Type'=>'地区显示类型','Select Location'=>'选择地区','Location Limit'=>'地区限制','Only Parent Location'=>'仅上级地区','Sort By'=>'排序方式','Hide Empty'=>'隐藏空项','Elements'=>'元素','Show Child location'=>'显示子地区','Sub Location Limit'=>'子地区限制','Show Counts'=>'显示数量','Count position'=>'数量位置','Enable Link'=>'启用链接','Show Description'=>'显示描述','Description Limit'=>'描述限制','Number of Responsive cols'=>'响应式列数','Desktops: >1199px'=>'桌面端：>1199px','Desktops: >991px'=>'桌面端：>991px','Tablets: >767px'=>'平板端：>767px','Phones: >575px'=>'手机端：>575px