e items left or right, use Align Items.'=>'此设置暂不生效：在垂直方向上它会上下分布项目，而容器当前的高度仅与其内容相同。请在上方设置最小高度以留出空间。如需左右移动项目，请使用“项目对齐”。','In Vertical direction this moves items left or right.'=>'在垂直方向上，此设置会左右移动项目。','Items can stay on a single line (No wrap), or break onto multiple lines (Wrap).'=>'项目可以保持在一行（不换行），也可以分成多行（换行）。','Container'=>'容器','Container Layout'=>'容器布局','Flexbox'=>'Flexbox','Content Layout'=>'内容布局','Boxed'=>'盒式','Full Width'=>'全宽','Content Width'=>'内容宽度','How wide the content inside is allowed to get. Leave empty to use the default %dpx.'=>'内部内容允许的最大宽度。留空则使用默认值 %dpx。','Container Width'=>'容器宽度','How wide the container itself is. Leave empty to fill whatever holds it.'=>'容器本身的宽度。留空则填满其父元素。','Min Height'=>'最小高度','To achieve a full height container use 100vh.'=>'如需全高容器，请使用 100vh。','Additional Options'=>'其他选项','HTML Tag'=>'HTML 标签','Overflow'=>'溢出','Hidden'=>'隐藏','Auto'=>'自动','Background Type'=>'背景类型','Gradient'=>'渐变','Any valid CSS gradient value.'=>'任意有效的 CSS 渐变值。','Replace Image'=>'替换图片','Select Image'=>'选择图片','Remove'=>'移除','Size'=>'尺寸','Cover'=>'覆盖','Contain'=>'包含','Attachment'=>'附着方式','Colors'=>'颜色','Text Color'=>'文字颜色','Border Color'=>'边框颜色','Border'=>'边框','Border Type'=>'边框类型','Border Width'=>'边框宽度','T-L'=>'左上','T-R'=>'右上','B-R'=>'右下','B-L'=>'左下','Box Shadow'=>'盒子阴影','X'=>'X','Y'=>'Y','Blur'=>'模糊','Spread'=>'扩展','Shadow Color'=>'阴影颜色','Inset'=>'内阴影','Relative'=>'相对','Absolute'=>'绝对','Sticky'=>'粘性','Spacing'=>'间距','Padding'=>'内边距','Leave empty to use the default %dpx.'=>'留空则使用默认值 %dpx。','Margin'=>'外边距','Positioning'=>'定位','Absolute and Fixed take the container out of the flow — the space it occupied closes up. Absolute is placed against the nearest positioned ancestor, which for a nested container is the one holding it.'=>'“绝对”和“固定”会使容器脱离文档流 — 它原本占据的空间会被收起。“绝对”相对于最近的已定位祖先元素进行定位，对于嵌套容器而言，即包含它的那个容器。','Z-Index'=>'Z-Index','Responsive'=>'响应式','Advanced'=>'高级','Hover Colors'=>'悬停颜色','Hover Text'=>'悬停文字','Hover Background'=>'悬停背景','Arrow icon'=>'箭头图标','Shows an arrow aft